  "body": "**What.** The math and physics papers say \"his own machine\", the README says \"his own machines\".\n\n**Why.** Digest, older open items (to settle).\n\n**Acceptance (each can fail).**\n- One wording in all three places.\n- Both papers build, and `check_numbers.py --selftest` passes.\n\n**Files.** [paper/physics/main.tex](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/paper/physics/main.tex), [paper/math/main.tex](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/paper/math/main.tex), [README.md](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/README.md)",
